      "duration": 8.0,
      "text": {
        "en": "Autumn came. The tortoise walked back down the hill to sleep through the winter.",
        "de": "Der Herbst kam. Die Schildkröte wanderte den Hügel hinab, um den Winter zu verschlafen."
      },
      "image": "res://resources/assets/cutscenes/story_walk_down.png"
